          "type": null,
          "body": "added 581 commits\n\n<ul><li>fcf2a5b7...ff1af2a1 - 580 commits from branch <code>wireshark:master</code></li><li>f4c42490 - HSFZ: Set default ports for handoff.</li></ul>\n\n[Compare with previous version](/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/19878/diffs?diff_id=1360795063&start_sha=fcf2a5b7984db820bd2e16f73d40cf0c22249d56)",
